Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.60,0:00:34.95,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:38.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（俄克拉荷马州 绿洲平原）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.59,0:00:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.69,0:00:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅 他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip. And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是老爸最珍贵的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他了解的有关恶魔的一切都记载在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.93,0:00:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things. The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为妈妈愿意我们这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think Mom would've wanted this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我一个人无法完成 - 我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't do this alone. - I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些房子很不错 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, these are some phat houses, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望能住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.17,0:01:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 可惜的是你负担不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Too bad you can't afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当这里修好了后 周围的房价也会特别高\N{\fnArial\fs30}This neighborhood will be damn expensive when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.05,0:01:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这地方太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.43,0:01:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这蚊子讨厌点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the mosquitoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.28,0:01:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快来救我 我掉下去了 我摔断了我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. l'm trapped! I broke my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去拿绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, l'll get a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.89,0:02:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 特拉维斯 快来救我 - 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Travis! Help! - Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特拉维斯 救我 啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 达斯汀 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Dustin, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.27,0:02:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达斯汀 我在这里 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin? Dustin, I'm here. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我们白天可以找份工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we could get day jobs once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.29,0:03:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎杀魔鬼才是我们的工作 但工资却是赌金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting's our day job. And the pay is crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以就去赌博 盗用信用卡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but hustling pool?Credit card scams?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可不是正经人该做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the most honest thing in the world, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这听上还有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see. Honest fun and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这根本没必要讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我们干的也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we're good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们从小就被这样教育\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what we were raised to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.66,0:03:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们被教会的只是欺骗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how we were raised was jacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随便你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, says you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们有了新状况 - 可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a new gig or what? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}俄克拉荷马州离这里不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oasis Plains, Oklahoma. Not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瓦斯公司的雇员\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gas-company employee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达斯汀·柏华斯突然死于疯牛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin Burwash supposedly died from Creutzfeldt-Jakob.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人类疯牛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human mad cow disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疯牛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个没上脱口秀节目吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't that on Oorah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.57,0:04:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也看脱口秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watch Oorah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来这个家伙吃了有病的汉堡包\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this guy eats a bad burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么是我们的问题呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it our kind of thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疯牛病导致脑部细胞的大量恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad cow disease causes massive brain degeneration.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过需要数个月 甚至几年才会出现症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}It takes months, even years, for the damage to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这个家伙达斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this guy Dustin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.65,0:04:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的脑子象在一个小时内就破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}sounds like his brain disintegrated in about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.38,0:04:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许时间更短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它也可能是种疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Now, it could be a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可能是某些鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it could be something much nastier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.61,0:04:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 去俄克拉荷马州\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Oklahoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man. Work, work, work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.24,0:04:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没时间享受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to spend my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:05:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特拉维斯·韦弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis Weaver?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是和叔叔达斯汀 一起工作的特拉维斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the Travis who worked with Uncle Dusty?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.76,0:05:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}达斯汀从没提起有个侄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dustin never mentioned nephews.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的吗 他可是有提到过你的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Well, he sure mentioned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说你是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you were the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.23,0:05:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 呵呵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Oh, he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想问问你 当时到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we wanted to ask you, what exactly happened out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不确定 他跌进了污水池\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure.He fell in a sinkhole.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.03,0:05:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跑到卡车那拿些绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to the truck to get some rope…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可在我回来前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and by the time I got back…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.06,0:05:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么 只有Dustin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Just Dustin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有伤痕或其它什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wounds or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.21,0:05:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的眼睛耳朵和鼻子都在流血 就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he was bleeding from his eyes and his ears, his nose. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这是疯牛病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think it could be this whole mad cow thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.59,0:05:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生是那么诊断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the doctors are saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.75,0:05:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可如果是疯牛病 他之前一定有奇怪的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it was, he would've acted strange beforehand…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如痴呆 情绪失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}like dementia, loss of motor control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.86,0:05:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你之前注意到他有这样过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever notice anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那不是病 那是什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then if it wasn't some disease, what the hell was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能告诉我们这是在哪里发生的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell us where this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.10,0:06:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不太清楚 但如果特拉维斯说的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. But if Travis was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.90,0:06:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这也发生的太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it happened pretty damn fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某种生物吞噬他的脑部吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}some sort of creature chewed on his brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但没有这样的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there'd be an entry wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来象伤害是在这里面造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like this thing worked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来只能一个人下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like there's only room for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.94,0:06:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掷硬币解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna flip a coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们不知道那下面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, we have no idea what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你害怕的话 我去好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. l'll go if you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 害怕吗 - 来 掷硬币解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Scared? - Flip the damn coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, call it in the air, chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.03,0:07:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说我去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l said l'd go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.53,0:07:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别把我扔下去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't drop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那个洞里找到了些甲虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you found some beetles. ln a hole in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这让我觉得奇怪 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's shocking, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里没有地道 没有通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were no tunnels, no tracks no evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.24,0:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里没有任何生物的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}of any other kind of creature down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你要知道 有些甲虫吃肉的 通常是死人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, some beetles do eat meat. It's usually dead meat, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在那里找到了多少只虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many did you find down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}10个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.30,0:07:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但要吞噬掉人的脑子 可需要到更多的虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd take more than that to eat out some dude's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许当时有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe there were more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.95,0:07:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来要慢慢解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a stretch to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要关于这个地区更多的资料 例如信息 街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more information on the area the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有是否有类似的事情发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether something like this has ever happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.16,0:07:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.32,0:07:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道有个好地方下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know a good place to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有个烤肉聚会 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of hungry for a little barbecue, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以和当地的人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't talk to the locals?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.59,0:08:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是想去吃白食吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The free food's got nothing to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.24,0:08:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.99,0:08:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很敬业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这样的环境长大我会疯掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing up in a place like this would freak me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看这修剪过的草地 天天重复的打招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manicured lawns, "How was your day, honey?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想这会让我疯掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd blow my brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}平凡的日子并没有错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing wrong with normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在家可过的不平凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd take our family over normal any day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.64,0:08:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.39,0:08:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有烤肉聚会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls this the barbecue?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但天气是不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not the best weather, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是 拉里派克 这里的开发商 你们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Larry Pike, the developer here.And you are…?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 这是 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 迪恩 很高兴认识你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean. Good to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:08:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们对这些房子有兴趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're interested in Oasis Plains?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我们接受任何种族 信仰 肤色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just say, we accept homeowners of any race, religion, color.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或性取向的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or sexual orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的父亲上了年纪了 我们想给他买套房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father's getting on in years. We're looking for a place for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.00,0:09:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老人也欢迎啊 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, seniors are welcome too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是难以置信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你是开发商\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were the developer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}18个月前我和我的调查组考察了这个峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eighteen months ago, I was walking this valley with my survey team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里除了丛林和松鼠外什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing here but scrub brush and squirrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们修建了一个如此美丽适合居住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, we built such a nice place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.01,0:09:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自己也来到这定居\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I actually bought into it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我们的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是第一户家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the first family in Oasis Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我老婆 乔安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my wife, Joanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}ere. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他们你有多喜欢这个地方 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them how much you love the place, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.28,0:09:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 如果需要你也撒点谎 因为我也需要卖掉房子 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lie if you have to… - because I need to sell some houses. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们 失陪一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别让他的商人本色吓到了你门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let his salesman routine scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是一个很值得居住的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This really is a great place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.21,0:09:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 我是琳达·布鲁姆 销售经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I'm Lynda Bloome, head of sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}琳达 是第2家搬进来住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lynda was second to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.15,0:10:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可是她真是个很吵的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a very noisy neighbor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's kidding, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.66,0:10:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你两很有兴趣成为业主吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you two are interested in becoming homeowners?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.40,0:10:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗯 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well… - Yeah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.68,0:10:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我们接受任何种族 信仰 肤色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just say that we accept homeowners of any race, religion, color.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或性取向的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or sexual orientation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.33,0:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我去和拉里谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go talk to Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吗 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有三种选择 地毯 硬木地板和瓷砖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got three choices Carpet, hardwood and tile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哇 有人喜欢虫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Someone likes bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.51,0:10:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的儿子 他沉迷于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son. He's into insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对这个很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very inquisitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.62,0:10:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁能抗拒蒸汽浴室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Who can say no to a steam shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.89,0:10:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每天都得用它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use mine every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.00,0:10:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有三种浴缸可以选择的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You also have three different whirlpool tubs to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}浴缸的器件是用镍和铜做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hardware for the tubs includes nickel or brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你去到厨房的时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the kitchen you can choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.49,0:10:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.74,0:10:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.70,0:11:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会告诉我爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.56,0:11:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 拉里通常在家庭介绍的时候都会忽略我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Larry usually skips me in the family introductions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样直呼你父亲 好象不太好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch. The first-name basis with the old man sounds pretty grim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不是什么宣传材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l'm not exactly brochure material.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要那样 会好转的 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hang in there. It gets better, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马修\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matthew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为我的儿子和他的宠物道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry about my son and his pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你想起某人了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind you of somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸从没对我们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad never treated us like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.68,0:12:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是老爸没对你那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dad never treated you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你太完美了 他总是在责怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were perfect. He was all over my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不记得了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许有的时候他凶了点 但有的时候是你过分了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he had to raise his voice, but sometimes you were out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.82,0:12:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 就像我说我宁愿去踢球 也不想学打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Like when I said I'd rather play soccer than learn bowhunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但打猎是个很重要的技能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowhunting's an important skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.01,0:12:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说了 你那边怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.How was your tour?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很棒 我想买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it was excellent. I'm ready to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你发现了点什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you might be on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.78,0:12:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来达斯汀·柏华斯不是在这的第一起离奇死亡事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like Dustin Burwash wasn't the first strange death here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.53,0:12:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概一年前 在他们破土动工前\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year ago, before they broke ground…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉里的调查小组中一员在工作的时候摔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of Larry's surveyors dropped dead on the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.87,0:12:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说是死于蜂螫后的剧烈过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this a severe allergic reaction to bee stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 应该是虫子干的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- More bugs. - More bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听过杀人蜂 可是杀人甲虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of killer bees, but killer beetles?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么让不同的昆虫来袭击呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it that could make different bugs attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.65,0:12:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有的时候虫子会聚集起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hauntings sometimes include bug manifestations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我没发现鬼魂的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't see any evidence of ghost activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他们被控制了 被某人或某样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're being controlled somehow. You know, by something or someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:12:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你指就象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like Willard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是虫子代替了老鼠而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Bugs instead of rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有好多人与动物精神联接的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are cases of psychic connections between people and animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}例如心灵感应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elementals, telepaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一些灵异事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the whole TimmyLassie thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉里的儿子 他把虫子当成宠物养\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry's kid. Bugs for pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.83,0:13:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 马特 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Matt? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.72,0:13:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想用一只狼蛛吓唬那个房产经济人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to scare the realtor with a tarantula.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为他就是我们要找的 吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's our Willard?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.32,0:13:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.35,0:13:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得什么都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything's possible, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.23,0:13:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, pull over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在这里干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在没法子再通知别人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late to talk to anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要呆在这个空房子里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna squat in an empty house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想试试这里的蒸汽浴室 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna try the steam shower. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿托卡县今天开始在此区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atoka Valley County began mandatory insecticide spraying across.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强制碰洒杀虫剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wide swath of the district today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}官方说作出喷杀决定是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities say the decision to spray was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伴随着某些区域内蚊虫的数量的大增\N{\fnArial\fs30}made because of several recent cases of West Nile virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出现了几起乃尔病毒的病例\N{\fnArial\fs30}coupled with a dramatic increase in the mosquito population in some areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然有些本地居民担心如此高浓度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although some residents cite concerns about the high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀虫剂的使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}levels of pesticide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.77,0:15:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还没出来吗 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever coming out of there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.33,0:15:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 有警察打电话进来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A police call came in on the scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人发现老爸就在三条街外 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone was found dead three blocks from here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个淋浴太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This shower is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我现在也不知道到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't know anything more right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.63,0:16:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊 你们来的好早啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. You're back early.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想看看新的邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just drove in to take another look at the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在烤饶聚会上遇到过 Linda Bloom\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys met Lynda Bloome at the barbecue?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个经济人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The realtor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.37,0:16:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她昨天晚上死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she passed away last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.73,0:16:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也想找出原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still trying to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让警察在检查尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I identified the body for the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 现在真的很糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, l'm sorry. This isn't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:16:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我们要怎么做了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what we have to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得到那个房子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Get in that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.93,0:17:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看是不是虫子的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if we got a bug problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This looks like the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}蜘蛛 那个喜欢蜘蛛的孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spiders. From Spider-Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.55,0:18:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他家是这条路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't his house that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.80,0:18:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 还记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Matt. Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们在这里干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.05,0:18:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.76,0:19:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们来这不是想买房子吧 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here to buy a house, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你们不是这一系列的杀手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're not serial killers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是 我想你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, I think you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 你知道很多关于虫子的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Matt…you sure know a lot about insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.83,0:19:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到发生在经济人 琳达 身上的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear what happened to Lynda, the realtor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今早听说她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l hear she died this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对的 蜘蛛咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Spider bites.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 你想用蜘蛛吓她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, you tried to scare her with a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你们认为我和这个有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You think I had something to do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你告诉我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.76,0:19:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个狼蛛只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tarantula was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且这也不能解释 蜜蜂攻击和燃气公司的职员的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, that wouldn't explain the bee attack or the gas-company guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也知道那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know about those?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.03,0:19:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有些事情在进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚 可我知道和虫子有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what, but something's happening with the insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我带你去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.56,0:20:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道了这些有关于虫子为什么不告诉你爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you knew about all this bug stuff, why not tell your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也许能让所有人离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he could clear everybody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信我 我试过了但是Larry不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, l've tried…but Larry doesn't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.47,0:20:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总而言之 他对他这个怪儿子很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly? He's too disappointed in his freak son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.34,0:20:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我知道 - 这你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hear you. - You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.93,0:20:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 你多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}16岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.44,0:20:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别太气愤了 两年后就还有更大事要发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat it, because in two years, something great's gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.42,0:20:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}College.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会离开这个家 离开你的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be able to get out of that house and away from your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.76,0:20:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么建议啊 一个小孩应该呆在他家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of advice is that? Kid should stick with his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还要走多久 马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much further.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt? We're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在追踪虫子的数量的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been keeping track of insect populations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.04,0:21:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是选修科学班的一部分作业\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of an AP science class.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你两还真像啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are like peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's been happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.14,0:21:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有许多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从蜜蜂到蚯蚓 甲虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, from bees to earthworms, beetles…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.70,0:21:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随你叫的出的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.45,0:21:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看上去它们就在这里聚集\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like they're congregating here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.95,0:22:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.53,0:23:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无名墓地下的一堆尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a bunch of skeletons in an unmarked grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许这就是聚集的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe this is a haunting. Pissed-off spirits…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某些愤怒的灵魂 还有它没完成的心愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}some unfinished business?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是为什么是虫子而且是在现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, why bugs? And why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.02,0:23:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是两个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到那个男孩的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, so with that kid back there…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么能教他和家里划清界限呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how could you tell him to just ditch his family like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是我知道那个男孩现在处于什么状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, I know what the kid's going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.08,0:23:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他尊敬他的老爸不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about telling him to respect his old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.71,0:23:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个建议怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.15,0:23:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这和他爸爸无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about his old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我不尊敬爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I didn't respect Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请忘记它 我很抱歉我那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's forget it. Sorry I brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.36,0:23:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尊敬他 可无论我怎么做 他都觉得不够好\N{\fnArial\fs30}l respected him. But no matter what I did, it was never good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是什么意思 你觉得老爸过去对你很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, Dad was disappointed in you? "Was"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.03,0:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是过去还是现在都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls. Always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么会那么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.59,0:23:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不想用弓去猎杀或是去骗傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't wanna bowhunt. Or hustle pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我想去上学 去过我自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wanted to go to school and live my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.50,0:24:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这却在让我在这家庭里成为了怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, in our whacked-out family, made me the freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.84,0:24:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就像是在怪兽家族里的小鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you were kind of like the blond chick in The Munsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.54,0:24:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 当一个孩子拿了满分后 大部分父亲会怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you know what most dads are when their kids score a full ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.42,0:24:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骄傲 他们绝不会把他的孩子赶出家门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proud. Most dads don't toss their kids out of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.14,0:24:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得那场争吵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.44,0:24:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上 我看来唤起了你的一些片段\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I seem to recall a few choice phrases coming out of your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.19,0:24:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 事实是当我们最后找到了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, truth is, when we finally do find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.71,0:24:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不知道他是否想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know if he's even gonna wanna see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.84,0:24:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆父亲从来没有对你失望过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dad was never disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.12,0:24:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.97,0:24:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.80,0:24:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.40,0:24:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他害怕如果他不在你身边 会有些事情发生在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was afraid of what could've happened to you if he wasn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.99,0:24:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使当你们在不说话的冷战期\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even when you two weren't talking…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.82,0:24:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他都尽可能的呆在斯坦福那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he used to swing by Stanford whenever he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.81,0:24:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着你 确定你很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on you. Make sure you were safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.65,0:25:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he tell me any of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.45,0:25:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那得看双方的意愿 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a two-way street, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.32,0:25:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时你应该接电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have picked up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.79,0:25:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 我们约会要迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We're gonna be late for our appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.84,0:25:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you two are students?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.05,0:25:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.05,0:25:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是你班上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in your class.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.47,0:25:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}课程代号101\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthro 1 01?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.36,0:25:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这骨头有什么 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what about the bones, professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.27,0:25:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们找到一件很有趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is quite an interesting find you've made.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.90,0:25:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说他有差不多170岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say they're 1 70 years old, give or take.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.44,0:25:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从时间历史和地理学 能充分证明这是土著人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time frame and the geography heavily suggest Native American.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.74,0:25:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个时候这片土地上有这样的部落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there any tribes or reservations on that land?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}历史记录上没有记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to the historical record.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.96,0:26:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是土著人的迁徙那个时候很普遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the relocation of native peoples was quite common at that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.04,0:26:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 那有没有些当地的传说 关于这个地方的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Well, are there any local legends? Oral histories about the area?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有个部落在萨帕尔帕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you know, there's a Euchee tribe in Sapulpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离这里大概60公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about 60 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.37,0:26:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那里的某人可能知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone out there might know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.37,0:26:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.81,0:27:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乔·怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe White Tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.66,0:27:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果允许的话 我们想问你几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to ask you a few questions, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.45,0:27:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是大学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're students from the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不是 你在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not. You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.08,0:27:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Well, truth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是骗子却用事这句话做为自己的开场白的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who starts sentence with "truth is"? Liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard of Oasis Plains?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些靠近阿托卡的住宅区吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a housing development near the Atoka Valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.70,0:27:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢他 他没撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him. He's not a liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.32,0:27:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能告诉我有关那里的历史吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you tell us about the history there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.61,0:27:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们为什么想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you wanna know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.46,0:28:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某些事情 某些不好的事在绿洲平原那里发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something…Something bad is happening in Oasis Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.74,0:28:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想它和我们在那里发现的 某些古老的尸骨有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think it might have something to do with some old bones we found there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}土著人的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Native American bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.93,0:28:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会告诉你 我祖父告诉我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what my grandfather told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.77,0:28:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而那是他祖父告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What his grandfather told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.65,0:28:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}200 年前 我的祖先居住在那个峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hundred years ago, a band of my ancestors lived in that valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.83,0:28:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天美国的殖民者来让他们迁走\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day the American cavalry came to relocate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们抵抗了 殖民者没了耐性\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were resistant…the cavalry impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.23,0:28:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我祖父说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}As my grandfather put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在晚上 月亮和太阳占的天空是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}"On the night the moon and the sun share the sky as equals…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.92,0:28:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天殖民者开始袭击村落\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cavalry first raided our village."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们烧杀 掳掠\N{\fnArial\fs30}They murdered, raped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.92,0:28:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二天他们又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day, the cavalry came again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.80,0:28:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天接一天直到第六天的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next and the next.And on the sixth night.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.94,0:29:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殖民者来的最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cavalry came one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.16,0:29:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在天亮前那刻所有在村落的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the time the sun rose…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.66,0:29:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男人 女人 小孩都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}every man, woman and child still in the village was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.64,0:29:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说在第六日的晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say on the sixth night…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.41,0:29:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}村落的首领在死去时\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the chief of the village lay dying…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.31,0:29:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对天低吟\N{\fnArial\fs30}he whispered to the heavens…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再没有白人能侵占这片土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no white man would ever tarnish this land again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.20,0:29:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自然会来保护这个峡谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature would rise up and protect the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.30,0:29:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会让殖民者给他的人民带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it would bring as many days of misery and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.36,0:29:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样的悲惨和死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the white man as the cavalry had brought upon his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虫子 这就是自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insects. Sounds like nature to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.80,0:29:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那六天呢 - 在第六天的晚上 没人能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six days. - And on the night of the sixth day…none would survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.00,0:30:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个燃气公司的雇员什么时候死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did the gascompany man die? Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.92,0:30:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来这是星期二 20 号是星期五\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see. We got here Tuesday, so Friday the 20th.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.24,0:30:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}5月20号 那是春分\N{\fnArial\fs30}rch 20th. That's the spring equinox.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.02,0:30:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太阳和月亮占的天空是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night the sun and the moon share the sky as equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.52,0:30:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以每年的这个时候 这里都会有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}So every year about this time, anybody in Oasis Plains is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉里的房子修在了被诅咒的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry built his neighborhood on cursed land.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第六个晚上 那就是今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the sixth night, that's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.90,0:30:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们不做些什么 拉里一家会在天亮前死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do something, Larry's family will be dead by sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.65,0:30:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怎么打破诅咒呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we break a curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.35,0:30:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不必打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't break a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.86,0:30:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你离开它 我们要把那些人带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out of its way. We gotta get those people out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.20,0:31:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 派克先生 在你的隔壁有很严重的煤气泄露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mr. Pike. There's a mainline gas leak in your neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:31:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 真的吗 多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. Really? How big?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.91,0:31:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在扩张的很大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fairly extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.18,0:32:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想吓唬你 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna alarm you. but.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.75,0:32:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要你在 2小时内撤离 为了安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need your family out of the vicinity for at least 12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.77,0:32:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再问一下 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be safe. Who is this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.93,0:32:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特拉维斯·韦弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travis Weaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.59,0:32:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为俄克拉荷马州燃气能源公司工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work for Oklahoma Gas and Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.51,0:32:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问题是我认识特拉维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}TravisThe problem is, I know Travis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.17,0:32:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一起工作了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's worked with us for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.34,0:32:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.96,0:32:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.78,0:32:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.31,0:32:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, it's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.52,0:32:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 后园里有很多蟑螂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, My back yard's crawling with cockroaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.28,0:32:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.67,0:32:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须马上带你全家离开那里 听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get your family out of that house now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.15,0:32:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为有东西会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.15,0:32:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很多虫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}More bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.41,0:32:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 很多很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.63,0:32:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最好的情形下 爸爸都不会听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad doesn't listen in the best of circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.76,0:32:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更何况现在是半夜11点半了 我该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.05,0:32:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要让他相信你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta make him listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.06,0:32:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.19,0:32:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 无论在那种情形下你说出事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under no circumstances are you to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.43,0:32:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他都会认为你在说胡话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll think you're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.61,0:32:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他是我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, he's my.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.91,0:32:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他你现在很疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you have a sharp pain in your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.14,0:32:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要去医院 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}side and you gotta go to the hospital. Ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.98,0:32:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Make him listen."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.33,0:33:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天那 他们还在这 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. They're still here. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我叫警察前 离开我的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off my property before I call the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.96,0:33:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}派克先生 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Pike. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.32,0:33:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 他们只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, they're just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.27,0:33:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.84,0:33:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我说出了事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I told him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系 马特到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a plan, Matt. What happened to the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.11,0:33:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着现在是晚上12点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. It's 12 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.16,0:33:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们马上就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.41,0:33:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须带走你的家人 不然就太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get your family and go. Before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 你是指圣经上所谓的灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, before the biblical swarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.73,0:33:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想想究竟在那个经纪人身上 到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, what do you think really happened to that realtor?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.81,0:33:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那个燃气公司的雇员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the gas-company guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这不奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think something weird's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.17,0:33:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你们是谁 但我只知道你们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who you are, but you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.68,0:33:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们再靠近我的孩子和家庭 我就得采取措施了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come near my boy or my family again, we're gonna have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.20,0:33:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也讨厌这样 可我们确实是有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a problem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸 他们是对的 我们有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, they're right.We're in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.77,0:34:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特 现在进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt, get inside! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Why won't you listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.44,0:34:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这很疯狂 这一点道理也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this is crazy! It doesn't make any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.13,0:34:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 这片土地被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this land is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.64,0:34:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们以前死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have died here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想拿你的家庭冒这个险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna take that risk with your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.29,0:34:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.10,0:34:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.70,0:34:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.71,0:34:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在该走了 拉里带上你妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go. Larry, get your wife. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.54,0:34:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.26,0:34:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.11,0:34:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从来没有遇到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.68,0:34:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家都进屋去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.46,0:34:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody in the house! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.43,0:34:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周围还有其它人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else in the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.93,0:34:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 只有我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.28,0:34:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 发生什么拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.03,0:34:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么这么吵 快报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}at's that noise? Call 91 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.23,0:34:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 乔安妮 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Joanie! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.02,0:35:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要毛巾 我们要把这里锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}towels. The closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.77,0:35:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 把门 窗壁和炉所有的都关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta lock this place up. Doors, windows, the fireplace, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.68,0:35:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电话不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phones are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.89,0:35:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们一定是咬断了电话线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have chewed through the phone lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.25,0:35:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the power lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我的手机能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe my cell…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.95,0:35:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.37,0:35:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本一点信号都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.23,0:35:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们正在敲打着房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're blanketing the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.47,0:35:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We try to outlast it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.69,0:35:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望太阳出来的时候诅咒能结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully the curse will end at sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.88,0:35:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仅仅只是希望吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hopefully"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.04,0:36:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 用杀虫剂 - 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bug spray? - Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.28,0:36:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}烟洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flue.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.91,0:36:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想大家得上楼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I think everybody needs to get upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大家快上楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody upstairs! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.82,0:36:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.72,0:36:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 Joanie\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.83,0:36:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.89,0:36:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.27,0:37:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特走 快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.05,0:37:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.84,0:37:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你进来了吗 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Hurry, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.61,0:37:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.54,0:37:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.29,0:37:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有东西在咬木头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's eating through the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.15,0:37:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白蚁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Termites.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.66,0:37:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 大家都退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Everybody get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.95,0:37:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}ck! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.15,0:37:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.45,0:38:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说对了 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ou got it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.91,0:38:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.75,0:38:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.83,0:40:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么不说声再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.37,0:40:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来得刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.34,0:40:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再过一小时我们就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another hour and we'd have been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.24,0:40:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For good?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.80,0:40:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开发计划被取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The development's on hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.37,0:40:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}政府在调查你们发现的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}while the government investigates the bones you found.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.76,0:40:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我会确定没人会再住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm gonna make damn sure no one lives here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.18,0:40:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看来并不生气啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't seem too upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我一生中最重要的经济危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this has been the biggest financial disaster of my career…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.50,0:40:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但某种程度上来说 我真的不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}but somehow…l really don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.08,0:40:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}s this? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.31,0:40:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 他们现在让我觉得恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kind of weird me out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.11,0:40:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I should hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.60,0:41:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想找到老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.47,0:41:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.87,0:41:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我… 我想和他道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I just… I wanna apologize to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.30,0:41:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.47,0:41:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为我对他说过的那些话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the things I said to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.03,0:41:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他尽力做到最好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just doing the best he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.94,0:41:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心 我们会找到他 那时你再道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}ll, don't worry. We'll find him. And you'll apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.09,0:41:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那时可能5分钟后 你们又要吵开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then within five minutes, you'll be at each other's throats.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.76,0:41:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.36,0:42:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 让我们上路吧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's hit the road. - Let's.
